# Local architecture and planning documents
/ATLAS_ARCHITECTURE.md
[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn][Ss]/
[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn][Nn][Ii][Nn][Gg]/
[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn].[Mm][Dd]
[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn][Nn][Ii][Nn][Gg].[Mm][Dd]
*_[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn].[Mm][Dd]
*-[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn].[Mm][Dd]
[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn]_*.md
[Pp][Ll][Aa][Nn]-*.md
